## Overview

A ground-up exploratory analysis of Uber's Delhi ride operations across all of 2024. The goal is not merely to describe the data — it's to answer real business questions: where do rides go wrong, where is revenue being left on the table, and what do the numbers mean operationally?

The analysis spans 14 visualisation sections, statistical deep-dives, and concludes with concrete, data-backed recommendations.

---

## Platform Snapshot

| Metric | Value | Share |
|---|---|---|
| Total Bookings | 148,770 | 100% |
| Completed Rides | ~93,000 | 65.96% |
| Driver Cancellations | ~27,000 | 18.15% |
| Customer Cancellations | ~11,000 | 7.45% |
| No Driver Found | ~11,000 | 7.40% |
| Incomplete Rides | ~9,500 | 6.04% |
| Vehicle Categories | 6 | — |
| Payment Methods | 5 | — |

