| 5 | `Customer ID` | String | Unique customer identifier |
| 6 | `Vehicle Type` | Categorical | Auto · Go Mini · Go Sedan · eBike/Bike · Premier Sedan · UberXL |
| 7 | `Pickup Location` | String | Ride origin |
| 8 | `Drop Location` | String | Ride destination |
| 9 | `Avg VTAT` | Float | Driver-to-pickup time (minutes) |
| 10 | `Avg CTAT` | Float | Pickup-to-drop time (minutes) |
| 11 | `Cancelled Rides by Customer` | Integer | Customer cancellation flag |
| 12 | `Reason for Cancelling by Customer` | Categorical | Root cause of customer cancellation |
| 13 | `Cancelled Rides by Driver` | Integer | Driver cancellation flag |
| 14 | `Driver Cancellation Reason` | Categorical | Root cause of driver cancellation |
| 15 | `Incomplete Rides` | Integer | Incomplete ride flag |
| 16 | `Incomplete Rides Reason` | Categorical | Root cause of incomplete ride |
| 17 | `Booking Value` | Float | Fare amount (₹) |
| 18 | `Ride Distance` | Float | Trip distance (km) |
| 19 | `Driver Ratings` | Float | Customer → Driver rating (1–5) |
| 20 | `Customer Rating` | Float | Driver → Customer rating (1–5) |
| 21 | `Payment Method` | Categorical | UPI · Cash · Credit Card · Uber Wallet · Debit Card |

