## Vehicle Fleet Summary

| Vehicle | Success Rate | Avg Distance | Notable |
|---------|-------------|--------------|---------|
| Auto | 91.1% | 25.99 km | Revenue leader; highest cancellation volume |
| Go Mini | 91.0% | 25.99 km | Most reliable relative to volume |
| Go Sedan | 91.1% | 25.98 km | Disproportionately high driver cancel rate |
| Premier Sedan | 91.2% | 25.95 km | Underperforms relative to Go Sedan |
| eBike / Bike | 91.1% | 26.11 km | Marginal revenue contribution |
| UberXL | 92.2% | 25.72 km | Highest success rate; lowest booking volume |

UberXL's 92.2% completion rate is the best in the fleet. Its riders book with intent and cancel far less frequently than other categories.

